  api[Smoke and API-level: scripts/smoke-test.mjs, BDD feature files]
  integ[Integration: Spring Boot tests with H2 and EmbeddedKafka<br/>Testcontainers variants skipped without Docker]
  unit[Unit: JUnit 5 + Mockito, pure OrderStateMachine matrix,<br/>Angular store tests, React Vitest tests, many, fast]
  e2e --> perf --> api --> integ --> unit
